### 환경 변수 설정
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@baseUrl = http://10.0.2.2:8000
@contentType = multipart/form-data

### 1. 포트홀 프레임 전송 테스트 (성공 시나리오)
# @name uploadFrame
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/frames
Content-Type: {{contentType}}; boundary=pothole-boundary

--pothole-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="header"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": {
    "lat": 35.1595,
    "lng": 126.8526
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-03-16T19:40:00Z"
}

--pothole-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="frame"; filename="test_sample_640.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_sample_640.jpg
--pothole-boundary--

### 2. 서버 상태 확인 (Health Check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health